      "content": "The challenges in Sub-Saharan Africa often stem from a combination of factors, rather than solely a lack of technical training. Cultural dynamics can influence approaches to hierarchy, deadlines, and direct accountability when compared to more rigid, process-driven models. This often translates to a need for significantly more hands-on oversight and robust, tailored local management structures to ensure consistent adherence to international standards.",
